      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: it was updated two days ago with SDK of 3.1.13 to test exactly that, and it didn't work.\n\nFact is, the updated finer grab controls are backwards-compatible, as the animation references a property called \"allowGrabbing\", which still changes to 0, even when recreated. At least in the case of switching it to False. The .anim files are identical.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
