      "value": "@{60cab5630e940039b6b7ed14|full_name}: I just did some testing and my suspicion was correct!\n\n# What I Found:\n\nYou can't animate the drop down it self, so setting the drop down to `True` / `False` via an animation will not work.\n\nWhat will work though is setting the drop down to `Other` and then animating / toggling the two check marks. When doing so you can animate grabbing etc without any problems.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing what I did:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/3o80k6.mp4",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
