      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: confirming; this workaround seems to function, cheers. Unfortunately, I can't edit the post body to add your solution to it.\n\nI suppose a better-fit question then follows.\n\n@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: why was this breaking change introduced without any notes? Moreover, it doesn't make sense for booleans to work, while a enum won't.",
