      "value": "@{60cab5630e940039b6b7ed14|full_name}: We have done testing internally but we have been unable to encounter any issue.  Using the latest SDK we are able to animate the new enum based Allow Grabbing and those animations worked when uploaded affecting if something could be grabbed.  We also tested uploading similar animations from an older SDK and those worked in the latest client.\n\nAt this time we don't have a repro for what is being described.  If someone is experiencing this issue we likely will need the project files of their affected avatar so we can inspect their animations and behaviour in client.",
